+# Knowledge
+
+Knowledge owns document persistence and its business API. Consumers use
+`Knowledge::Catalog.list(tenant_id:)` to read published document snapshots; the
+Active Record models remain private implementation details.
+
+## Persistence rollback
+
+This extraction intentionally makes no schema or record conversion. If a future
+persistence change is attempted, first take the application/database backup and
+record the pre-change revision, then verify the existing model can still read all
+records. Roll back by restoring the backup and reverting the persistence patch;
+keep this boundary and its characterization tests unchanged until equivalent IDs,
+revisions, tenant ownership, publication state, and transaction behavior are
+verified.
